@mattpocock-community/dsh-engineering-skills README · Matt Pocock Agent Skills — for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)：A DeepSeek Harness **bundle plugin** that ports Matt Pocock's
[_"Skills for Real Engineers"_](https://github.com/mattpocock/skills) set into
native, discoverable DSH skills.

@mattpocock-community/dsh-engineering-skills README · Productivity (7 of 7)：Each enabled skill is a single-level `skills/<name>/` directory with its
resources (`agents/openai.yaml`, `scripts/*`, reference `.md`) kept alongside.
DSH discovers them exactly like any local skill.

@mattpocock-community/dsh-engineering-skills README · Disabled skills (30)：To ship one, add its name to `enabled-skills.json` and run
`npm run sync:upstream -- --prune`. `node scripts/sync-upstream.mjs --all`
ignores the file and ships everything.

@mattpocock-community/dsh-engineering-skills README · or from a local checkout / tarball：The skills appear in the model's catalog alongside your normal local skills —
on every DSH surface (web, TUI, headless). User-only skills additionally appear
in the `/` slash menu after the profile restarts and a session (re)opens.
